Increases the amount of damage you can deal to sleeping targets before reducing the effect duration by [4%, 19%, 29%, 37%, 43% (TL1-5)], and reduces the sleep immunity of your Insomnia effects by [2%, 5%, 7%, 8%, 9% (TL1-5)].

These effects will be directly reflected in the appropriate talent descriptions.

The damage threshold bonus will scale with your Mindpower.
